Preserve the existing watch-backed invalidation assertion. Without a content watch, require a full unchanged-record reread and refreshed persisted stamp; reject an equal-length valid-JSON immutable identity mutation and preserve the original file. Keep the existing unsafe-cache permission rejection.

This changes one test function only. Production source and the reassembled frozen REA ledger remain byte-identical to 942d470.

